      "title": "Accommodation",
      "value": "<p>The New York accommodation for students is located off-campus. Students can stay in the official residence, which is a short subway ride from the campus in Battery Place. Accommodation varies from single to double rooms. These come with different amenities including a refrigerator, microwave, television and wifi.</p><p>Alternatively, you can find shared accommodation in New York with support from the Academy Housing Coordinator. However, you will have to visit accommodation in New York before committing to rented housing.</p>",
